<title>FRANCE: Thais order Matra-BAE air defence system.</title>
<headline>Thais order Matra-BAE air defence system.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matra Defense Espace said on Monday the Thai navy ordered several Sadral/Mistral air defence systems from its Matra-BAe Dynamics joint venture.</p>
<p>The company gave no details of the size or the value of the order.</p>
<p>A defence industry source said the order was worth between 100 and 500 million francs. French daily Le Monde said earlier on Monday the order was worth more than 200 million francs.</p>
<p>The company also announced a second order of Simbad/Mistral missile systems from Indonesia following an initial deal in February.</p>
</text>
